cf52166" ulx="38" uly="1164" lrx="431" lry="1196" /><zone xml:id="m-771c8a14-fb9a-4bf2-bf43-9716e90be3ea" ulx="38" uly="1187" lrx="432" lry="1219" /><zone xml:id="m-cdf8987e-0eca-4fdb-aa17-7ca670741f65" ulx="443" uly="1189" lrx="837" lry="1220" /><zone xml:id="m-cb3e7510-ae8b-484b-b0ec-316baa1ec5ed" ulx="40" uly="1218" lrx="810" lry="1251" /><zone xml:id="m-89c33aef-9d5f-4049-a504-4eca28e2ac05" ulx="48" uly="1311" lrx="155" lry="1345" /><zone xml:id="m-d4fd9354-3134-402a-befb-18f0432798ab" ulx="72" uly="1385" lrx="119" lry="1426" /><zone xml:id="m-69ea059e-1a11-45bc-93dd-d5957bb0c5cd" ulx="161" uly="1394" lrx="283" lry="1433" /><zone xml:id="m-5e80bf19-9502-4d1f-a23e-2d49f2ce4c5a" ulx="499" uly="1394" lrx="532" lry="1428" /><zone xml:id="m-4c4a7a05-304c-4370-8835-afec5b487cb7" ulx="592" uly="1394" lrx="800" lry="1428" /><zone xml:id="m-1040acd9-970a-4811-90eb-b2a80ba556d7" ulx="354" uly="1395" lrx="435" lry="1434" /><zone xml:id="m-5e5c4980-9bf3-42cc-a5a9-82cc5339020c" ulx="90" uly="1433" lrx="219" lry="1469" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-027fc97e-3d5e-4f42-9d80-daeb1dda0edc" n="0769" facs="#m-267aa1e0-b7e5-461e-b948-2e84779323da" /><div xml:id="m-68e7557d-6bbe-4faf-a98c-b43223e6ae75">
            <lg xml:id="m-19f48317-9917-4c64-90fb-bbae26ec6219">
              <l xml:id="m-de5c74a8-f252-442a-bcea-2c3de9fc0ff9" facs="#m-e552a220-181f-498d-8ccc-713a45345db6" label="ambiguous">Wednesday in Holy Week</l><l xml:id="m-ce3c9642-64b2-46cb-99ad-1acc2625a88e" facs="#m-0d24f4e6-34da-4fdb-803f-36d75946d151" label="ambiguous">623</l><l xml:id="m-5117fad4-e674-43e9-b12b-6077d89cd891" facs="#m-707358c1-f131-49cf-b462-ba543a45a917" label="lyrics-like">et mulierum, quae plangébant crepábat eum, dicens : S. Neque</l><l xml:id="m-8767b33d-d0a2-49ca-b6b8-f974222c2478" facs="#m-eae9dd0b-4dad-4ca7-be2c-6f890638eaf9" label="lyrics-like">et lamentabántur eum. Convér¬</l><l xml:id="m-23f3c08e-4dc2-4efa-9f19-d6473c932c84" facs="#m-7f14ea90-b980-49f4-8ac2-bd19a066c552" label="lyrics-like">tu times Deum, quod in eádem</l><l xml:id="m-09a5b194-1081-4ab9-9431-24e5467eabdc" facs="#m-5795171d-beb3-46b4-9fe5-a02ecc8f8ec8" label="lyrics-like">damnatióne es. Et nos quidem</l><l xml:id="m-1a3c3078-dd17-442a-812f-1f41c3711422" facs="#m-6ebb92f4-33c0-46db-8bbc-4585e1a8826d" label="ambiguous">sus autem ad illas Jesus, dixit :</l><l xml:id="m-124b2231-02df-4879-b4de-2b1e3d76b1e3" facs="#m-e24885dc-e6e4-4137-8aef-41b8324d59a2" label="lyrics-like">juste, nam digna factis recípi¬</l><l xml:id="m-e291d70c-aa7e-44eb-9999-264bd89c0938" facs="#m-b1edd29d-ff77-4985-912b-929fd9de2a87" label="lyrics-like">★ Filiae Jerúsalem, nolíte fiere</l><l xml:id="m-c21980b7-1037-411e-b325-cc656c33cc16" facs="#m-2c6cd7b9-9ce5-4020-88e6-241e56ef8d3c" label="ambiguous">mus: hic vero nihil mali gessit.</l><l xml:id="m-81cb9bba-83c3-4faf-98a9-8234eca79422" facs="#m-4e9c0a46-e67f-4109-9d75-87c0e05d11fe" label="ambiguous">super me, sed super vos ipsas</l><l xml:id="m-dbbc5625-59b4-4519-a573-46f7c328d53c" facs="#m-ee4e073d-e2ae-4838-9cab-88309db15e20" label="lyrics-like">C. Et dicébat ad Jesum: D</l><l xml:id="m-3d2624ec-5bd2-4057-8690-6840c77ae552" facs="#m-1e825491-a4fd-4aef-bf65-7d35c575bb91" label="ambiguous">flete, et super filios vestros.</l><l xml:id="m-fd98b78c-3720-4115-90a0-6835f6d437ae" facs="#m-b76577c6-bd25-4dec-959b-a171421ef253" label="lyrics-like">mine, meménto mei, cum véneris</l><l xml:id="m-db336c94-54ee-4d81-a1b4-ca3c5470e477" facs="#m-0ed6c81f-4c30-4087-9538-7215a8df69db" label="lyrics-like">Quóniam ecce vénient dies, in</l><l xml:id="m-29325849-5f20-4380-b65b-23930fdbda68" facs="#m-fe667734-7f20-4139-a105-c2fd069475bf" label="lyrics-like">quibus dicent: Beâtae stériles,</l><l xml:id="m-4ec1f423-4a62-4681-945f-e1ccfc37383d" facs="#m-67afb1b1-84e1-44d4-8dc2-2ddbd3e19b3d" label="ambiguous">in regnum tuum. C. Et dixit</l><l xml:id="m-62fe9973-f461-49cb-889d-9dd914edd574" facs="#m-3edc3b15-9ca0-47b6-99d9-3ad5b26e0649" label="ambiguous">illi Jesus: 4 Amen dico tibi:</l><l xml:id="m-22b3c10b-2322-484d-81ee-5c5f08d57f3a" facs="#m-d97200d7-6af5-4b8b-8e20-44b04ca54200" label="lyrics-like">et ventres, qui non genuérunt,</l><l xml:id="m-f788234e-8873-4e99-89f2-7cd695dd9797" facs="#m-5596cfd5-6701-40ed-8d9d-b987e2b89739" label="lyrics-like">et úbera, quae non lactavérunt.</l><l xml:id="m-087c2731-eb9d-4cf4-b0c3-f7202c0079aa" facs="#m-aef1f882-b366-42c8-a812-18266845b6c0" label="lyrics-like">Hódie mecum eris in paradíso.</l><l xml:id="m-3900b810-2e7b-4742-867c-1869a6c787b6" facs="#m-6e6be46e-0e3c-4d88-9d54-33cb5794a6b8" label="ambiguous">C. Erat autem fere hora sexta,</l><l xml:id="m-76602b40-5a4b-4da0-bbaa-7fe4baa6aff3" facs="#m-c9e6c51d-faf6-4459-a565-4fee37df484e" label="lyrics-like">Tunc incipient dicere móntibus:</l><l xml:id="m-0cc7bf62-c82f-4a96-a11a-71d3b7a28096" facs="#m-57fffe76-1e96-4657-8f34-893dddd1af79" label="lyrics-like">et ténebrae factae sunt in uni¬</l><l xml:id="m-d7e5f6cc-9c2f-4b52-8ae4-a976cabcb587" facs="#m-826f616f-9bce-4ed0-a2e0-b1eb326ea50c" label="lyrics-like">cádite super nos; et cóllibus:</l><l xml:id="m-a55b7474-757c-40c7-8394-d7f6d69be828" facs="#m-33a52d18-2d50-4d45-9d7c-a649c8b313e6" label="ambiguous">operite nos. Quia si in viridi</l><l xml:id="m-c18be3c9-4fdd-4282-82be-c9ef5a2a60f3" facs="#m-fbc51d00-33c9-4b72-88ec-18896fb509fd" label="lyrics-like">vérsam terram usque in horam</l><l xml:id="m-14947d93-d101-4809-8fe1-db92d3552bee" facs="#m-ba46fc4a-3b0a-46df-bf5b-ae071cc7bda1" label="lyrics-like">nonam. Et obscurátus est sol:</l><l xml:id="m-e57f2f64-9a2b-4c13-8def-1870c1b74f36" facs="#m-e014143f-a590-4b63-937f-42d44ef30477" label="lyrics-like">ligno haec fáciunt, in árido quid</l><l xml:id="m-3397fa53-44c6-4178-97cf-f7b85db00e6c" facs="#m-a888c81e-9a0d-4afa-ab8d-c1a224d68572" label="ambiguous">et velum templi scissum est</l><l xml:id="m-9d1e926d-7f1f-4736-95c9-316127063b6d" facs="#m-15081d2a-fe51-4be5-824f-207ac24e39ee" label="ambiguous">net?</l><l xml:id="m-af2074e4-69c8-41ba-bc35-b05419291bdd" facs="#m-6d07c102-7311-4d9b-b2a4-191f3a9a4af3" label="lyrics-like">C. Ducebántur autem et álii</l><l xml:id="m-c555c7ed-c85a-4506-b1eb-2f970353e113" facs="#m-de99a2c9-5115-46fc-9dda-2edd295f8fcb" label="lyrics-like">médium. Et clamans voce magna</l><l xml:id="m-b08e573a-39f1-4b13-86d3-e9ac366eca3b" facs="#m-0eef8841-0fde-496c-9336-3609c40934b1" label="ambiguous">Jesus, ait: 4 Pater, in manus</l><l xml:id="m-362f5739-c4a7-4b50-b464-6e5196cad7c7" facs="#m-1760b64e-3967-49dd-b980-f35a7ca5177e" label="ambiguous">duo nequam cum eo, ut inter¬</l><l xml:id="m-13c18bb3-7a52-4c63-bd96-503ab290fca1" facs="#m-7e55d0cf-972b-4944-bf69-ee9befc1b573" label="lyrics-like">ficeréntur. Et postquam vené¬</l><l xml:id="m-a2d264d4-cfec-4920-80d5-dbe7e0702992" facs="#m-b94b85f3-ebe8-4277-9d1d-75b17a5e3f75" label="lyrics-like">tuas comméndo spíritum meum.</l><l xml:id="m-dd92cd95-70df-4d8c-9aa4-ce43a22aa9ab" facs="#m-d1067e14-c2f1-4696-8b34-68cfaac93d72" label="lyrics-like">runt in locum, qui vocátur Cal¬</l><l xml:id="m-3998f58c-cb38-442c-8e9b-666fef5bbc8f" facs="#m-6c765078-f81d-426a-bc85-d17a2a277c53" label="lyrics-like">C. Et haec dicens, exspirávit.</l><l xml:id="m-7e11f18a-d919-4228-9f57-53e91baaaef9" facs="#m-ab80d0c1-058c-4b91-93d2-2c07fc251af1" label="text-like">(Here a pause is made, and all</l><l xml:id="m-98981db5-87b5-49cf-8b6b-424d58bb1c0c" facs="#m-769a21cb-64fe-4293-9d38-58f72e23c87a" label="lyrics-like">váriae, ibi crucifixérunt eum:</l><l xml:id="m-115974e8-b952-4f2f-a21d-c87566e11ef8" facs="#m-5f937502-2feb-4579-870c-cfbd2c9144ce" label="ambiguous">kneel).</l><l xml:id="m-88469808-a22f-42ff-b9d3-196d2331a4a6" facs="#m-0ae14ce6-b47d-476e-bdba-546bce85fa66" label="lyrics-like">et latrónes, unum a dextris, et</l><l xml:id="m-2c375993-05d9-45cd-967f-0c5758cd792e" facs="#m-8ca756fd-39e9-4316-b879-1de00f4096ee" label="lyrics-like">álterum a sinístris. Jesus autem</l><l xml:id="m-a8ae5b4c-5821-48ab-aed1-fbd97d0f85b5" facs="#m-bbf6bc64-3cf1-4633-a322-f54c16a97179" label="lyrics-like">Videns autem centúrio quod</l><l xml:id="m-ed221952-82d3-4f4a-9df9-01b56ffab421" facs="#m-dedc0b65-fdff-478a-9242-b574557e9580" label="lyrics-like">dicébat: 4 Pater, dimitte illis:</l><l xml:id="m-2867ff31-6dff-47cf-b9e9-fe2e58ddb79e" facs="#m-705975c6-7f8f-4ff6-b774-d5c1fe148263" label="lyrics-like">factum fúerat, glorificávit Deum,</l><l xml:id="m-14cdc2d2-034e-40d5-8200-1b510e9d5e53" facs="#m-0330adf6-be96-4942-b668-4d0556c47b3a" label="lyrics-like">non enim sciunt quid fáciunt.</l><l xml:id="m-65acf681-6904-4e89-9ac8-5ae56e8e0aff" facs="#m-7c57addc-278c-42e5-b243-781f1b7cd4d6" label="ambiguous">dicens: S. Vere hic homo justus</l><l xml:id="m-5312db0e-6797-46e0-8d85-9075eed1f9e0" facs="#m-4c58ee1e-1fd7-4b37-bff6-52c18fa7612f" label="lyrics-like">C. Dividéntes vero vestiménta</l><l xml:id="m-da5c2bc3-8cd1-470a-8682-a5d5e57db4ac" facs="#m-21a93296-0a28-4f2b-b9be-7a5fe036629f" label="lyrics-like">erat. C. Et omnis turba eórum,</l><l xml:id="m-421afd13-32ab-499f-aa2a-018175122096" facs="#m-157689e6-89e3-499d-8148-84037234f13d" label="lyrics-like">ejus, misérunt sortes. Et stabat</l><l xml:id="m-f8f9fabe-0339-4cd4-9735-83b10f088dbb" facs="#m-f27b71b6-028f-4fe7-b4cb-94960b059578" label="lyrics-like">qui simul áderant ad spectácu¬</l><l xml:id="m-c139d041-1496-4b2a-9b76-1822c5c578b3" facs="#m-1d2666b0-e05d-4740-ab52-60e688b32d7b" label="lyrics-like">pópulus spectans, et deridébant</l><l xml:id="m-0827fc53-dc1f-499c-8a6c-521590fb3804" facs="#m-25100ab4-e099-42bb-96e0-51f82741b2ed" label="lyrics-like">lum istud, et vidébant quae</l><l xml:id="m-8f4a43ad-1000-42d7-bcf0-51129362ef47" facs="#m-98e08c27-81fb-4128-9119-214b24103b43" label="lyrics-like">fébant, percutiéntes péctora sua</l><l xml:id="m-e71ddba8-6994-4e1d-8170-a345b7b9816e" facs="#m-cf5d7600-ba13-4c62-8e3e-7b96c99d44ff" label="lyrics-like">eum principes cum eis, dicéntes:</l><l xml:id="m-06d8b696-8f06-4691-ac6f-3cec5fc8c63d" facs="#m-40bcb932-2184-4b8e-8579-a5c40efeedda" label="ambiguous">S. Alios salvos fecit : se salvum</l><l xml:id="m-90ae8211-d320-4094-b749-60d185c89553" facs="#m-0b5cf76a-9119-483e-aaad-efae4c47f67f" label="lyrics-like">revertebãntur. Stabant autem</l><l xml:id="m-da19292d-f7e2-4e96-ae2f-de8441a82408" facs="#m-edf37b1b-95d1-45a6-97e0-1c1778804d8c" label="lyrics-like">fáciat, si hic est Christus Dei</l><l xml:id="m-da2b7071-3c0f-43b0-9dc5-888c871bd111" facs="#m-ff0a70c7-ffa5-4416-a973-fc71a4df5efa" label="ambiguous">omnes noti ejus a longe, et</l><l xml:id="m-3591b972-7821-4b05-9423-a17bd97c39ed" facs="#m-36c14b36-8bd1-49dd-93a9-d8c32081eca0" label="lyrics-like">eléctus. C. Illudébant autem ei</l><l xml:id="m-31e4ec2f-7c36-4a2e-85e7-33e344e14797" facs="#m-cfedb9a9-49ca-4f34-809e-86c0cac2bf7c" label="lyrics-like">mulieres, quae secútae eum erant</l><l xml:id="m-aff5db93-dc05-49de-a9ca-e4096faabea8" facs="#m-72c705a1-6982-4cf3-bcf4-c9798a3b253b" label="lyrics-like">a Galilaéa, haec vidéntes.</l><l xml:id="m-027cf714-054c-41e7-99fc-34b22b2faf04" facs="#m-b5c15087-d482-4ba8-b58f-1d66f6022ee7" label="lyrics-like">et milites accedéntes, et acétum</l><l xml:id="m-11531dc7-17d7-4578-bdd9-c4695e04a51a" facs="#m-8a5dfb78-b8b2-4b1f-b612-e7a0f48a90bc" label="lyrics-like">offeréntes ei, et dicéntes : S. Si</l><l xml:id="m-f30a60e0-24ab-48d9-9dd8-9cab0f42e64b" facs="#m-203d0c86-f1ff-4d35-a9a2-022caebdfb94" label="lyrics-like">Et ecce vir nómine Joseph,</l><l xml:id="m-1fb4aab5-6584-4f34-87f2-7c1e460de9f1" facs="#m-c52d7c9b-5fca-4ed9-aada-d41e240963fd" label="lyrics-like">qui erat decúrio, vir bonus et</l><l xml:id="m-17356b15-7781-4d16-9399-75359f3269d4" facs="#m-5ea0de97-4190-43ac-8ffe-865f1eeeb390" label="lyrics-like">tu es Rex Judacórum, salvum</l><l xml:id="m-e57ce92f-ef14-4188-a74b-79a603aee6c1" facs="#m-f90278c5-4c17-4cdb-bb28-0243576bf0fb" label="ambiguous">te fac. C. Erat autem et super¬</l><l xml:id="m-a09e14b7-15c8-4ef8-95e8-df6be9ef7d72" facs="#m-9996f27e-4f04-4bb6-91fa-e9573e5c2361" label="lyrics-like">justus: hic non consénserat</l><l xml:id="m-ba73dd90-3f4d-44b5-a2c5-d8d82aee9d3b" facs="#m-26a33ddd-38d8-44b6-9530-c4bcb120ef24" label="lyrics-like">consilio et áctibus eórum, ab</l><l xml:id="m-292c8eb1-5844-4b15-99c5-23d1c429b42c" facs="#m-3375e990-7d78-4afe-b1a3-7338c04bab4a" label="lyrics-like">scríptio scripta super eum litteris</l><l xml:id="m-15251acd-692d-4833-a18c-f2d000892415" facs="#m-24cfa53c-c9b7-41b3-b390-c388842d8299" label="lyrics-like">graecis, et latinis, et hebráicis:</l><l xml:id="m-25e3c375-9e19-4880-af09-91c1c9f30968" facs="#m-45e4735a-a57f-4b8b-9f35-23025d973321" label="lyrics-like">Arimathaéa civitáte Judaéae, qui</l><l xml:id="m-ebfe655a-f766-4d5d-8d62-d5464602d9e4" facs="#m-196f8731-1832-4c8b-99e1-17c64c640170" label="lyrics-like">Hic est Rex Judaeórum. Unus</l><l xml:id="m-19b653f4-5168-4c30-8add-13cb1bdf5729" facs="#m-4cc9e767-a192-4739-b762-aa5d8eb0543f" label="lyrics-like">exspectábat et ipse regnum Dei.</l><l xml:id="m-e958328d-c2b2-40b3-b973-71c01d74f436" facs="#m-da750066-7b8e-48ca-829a-d53e4039d5af" label="lyrics-like">Hic accéssit ad Ṕilátum, et pétiit</l><l xml:id="m-41ad9a86-0a2c-4261-9ac9-cd68358699a7" facs="#m-f5859ff8-0dd0-4f80-826d-16eed67d28b4" label="lyrics-like">autem de his, qui pendébant,</l><l xml:id="m-f2304d07-f769-4393-91e2-5a4fe26ac2e5" facs="#m-f4b195ad-6edb-43ff-9be8-9e0d5e5736df" label="lyrics-like">corpus Jesu: et depósitum in¬</l><l xml:id="m-3fb4c331-88d4-482c-afd6-50683dbe1c32" facs="#m-83009657-5d69-4f2b-a4ba-a05de7bed129" label="lyrics-like">latrónibus, blasphemábat eum,</l><l xml:id="m-85878847-b621-4ab4-9934-4b21a29a4e2d" facs="#m-4c0cada1-370b-47f6-8a62-0e760598638a" label="lyrics-like">vólvit sindone, et pósuit eum in</l><l xml:id="m-f6e782c7-24b4-4d9e-82d4-4fc01b4941d9" facs="#m-cfd9c35f-e6a5-4a14-8be5-6da25cf52166" label="ambiguous">dicens: S. Si tu es Christus,</l><l xml:id="m-ec9597b0-d022-4a2a-966f-66d035a51ff2" facs="#m-771c8a14-fb9a-4bf2-bf43-9716e90be3ea" label="lyrics-like">salvum fac temetípsum, et nos.</l><l xml:id="m-5e5e8421-4a3a-4782-bdad-1224b9810bb3" facs="#m-cdf8987e-0eca-4fdb-aa17-7ca670741f65" label="lyrics-like">monuménto excíso, in quo non¬</l><l xml:id="m-5683cef4-1bc7-4d97-8757-759b29adf347" facs="#m-cb3e7510-ae8b-484b-b0ec-316baa1ec5ed" label="lyrics-like">C. Respóndens autem alter in- dum quisquam pósitus fuerat.</l><l xml:id="m-252fb605-1bc6-470b-98f6-be4357b2c9bb" facs="#m-89c33aef-9d5f-4049-a504-4eca28e2ac05" label="ambiguous">ofrert.5</l><l xml:id="m-a15f1a5f-9753-4965-8d9a-aab23668227c" facs="#m-d4fd9354-3134-402a-befb-18f0432798ab" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-3deb7b83-58de-44be-95d8-71eb99e3c220" facs="#m-69ea059e-1a11-45bc-93dd-d5957bb0c5cd" label="ambiguous">Omi-ne,</l><l xml:id="m-c09946e4-0c67-4094-ae98-308e4a12cd3c" facs="#m-5e80bf19-9502-4d1f-a23e-2d49f2ce4c5a" label="ambiguous">di</l><l xml:id="m-4ceab87e-65a4-4172-9981-d3dee4f1899e" facs="#m-4c4a7a05-304c-4370-8835-afec5b487cb7" label="ambiguous">0- ra-ti-6-nem</l><l xml:id="m-c305b8e2-0607-4fb4-8afe-fa64070598b0" facs="#m-1040acd9-970a-4811-90eb-b2a80ba556d7" label="lyrics-like">exáu¬</l><l xml:id="m-7e160d5a-02d5-4977-bc6d-4da4c31a8bc2" facs="#m-5e5c4980-9bf3-42cc-a5a9-82cc5339020c" label="ambiguous">N°sol.— 25</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>